# Keep the deployment (and the Serverless Function count) lean.
#
# Vercel turns every file under api/ into a Serverless Function unless it lives
# in an underscore-prefixed path or is ignored here — and the Hobby plan allows
# 12 per deployment.
#
# NOTE: this file also controls what is uploaded to the BUILD container, so
# anything the build needs (scripts/ runs during `prebuild`) must stay.

# Test suites — run in CI, never deployed, and each api/*.test.js would
# otherwise be counted as a Serverless Function.
*.test.js

# CI definition (not used by the build)
ci/

# Docs
*.md
!README.md

# Local artefacts
.env*
!.env.example
dist/
coverage/
